  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "My father built a house with one too many empty chairs",
      "bar": 1,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse1"
    },
    {
      "text": "and kept the porch light burning like he wanted one door more",
      "bar": 3,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse1"
    },
    {
      "text": "I used to think that all that waiting was how you say your prayers",
      "bar": 5,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse1"
    },
    {
      "text": "now I know it's just a man who's memorized the floor",
      "bar": 7,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse1"
    },
    {
      "text": "I never learned to sit still long enough to learn a name",
      "bar": 9,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse2"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'd love a town for one whole season, then I'd love the road again",
      "bar": 11,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse2"
    },
    {
      "text": "my mother says I run from anything that dares to make a claim",
      "bar": 13,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse2"
    },
    {
      "text": "and prays that I come home and mean it, one of these days, amen",
      "bar": 15,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse2"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm nobody's native son",
      "bar": 17,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus"
    },
    {
      "text": "not one harbor, not one soul",
      "bar": 18,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm nobody's native son",
      "bar": 19,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus"
    },
    {
      "text": "but I loved you like my home",
      "bar": 20,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus"
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a wind out past the reservoir that never learned to aim",
      "bar": 21,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse3"
    },
    {
      "text": "it just moves because it's moving, not because it's owed a reason",
      "bar": 23,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse3"
    },
    {
      "text": "I used to think that I was running, now I think I'm just the same",
      "bar": 25,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse3"
    },
    {
      "text": "kind of animal that migrates when it feels the change of season",
      "bar": 27,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "verse3"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm nobody's native son",
      "bar": 29,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus2"
    },
    {
      "text": "not one harbor, not one soul",
      "bar": 30,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus2"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm nobody's native son",
      "bar": 31,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus2"
    },
    {
      "text": "but I loved you like my home",
      "bar": 32,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus2"
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a word for missing somewhere you have never been",
      "bar": 33,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 12,
      "section": "bridge"
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know it, but I feel it every time the light goes low",
      "bar": 35,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 12,
      "section": "bridge"
    },
    {
      "text": "some places keep you even when you've never once walked in",
      "bar": 37,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 12,
      "section": "bridge"
    },
    {
      "text": "and some you leave a hundred times and still can't let it go",
      "bar": 39,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 12,
      "section": "bridge"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm nobody's native son",
      "bar": 41,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus3"
    },
    {
      "text": "not one harbor, not one soul",
      "bar": 42,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus3"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm nobody's native son",
      "bar": 43,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "chorus3"
    },
    {
      "text": "but I loved you like a hometown -- and I mean it, after all",
      "bar": 44,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "chorus3"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nobody's native son",
      "bar": 46,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 4,
      "section": "outro"
    },
    {
      "text": "nobody's, nobody's, native son",
      "bar": 47,
      "beat": 1,
      "duration": 8,
      "section": "outro"
    }
  ]
